        },
        "labels": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": "Only the threads that carry every one of these labels (feature `labels`)."
        },
        "cursor": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "`threads/list`. Without an agent: the threads the Host has a journal for, across\nagents, most recently active first. With one: that agent's in `cwd`, the Host's own first,\nthen the agent's own listing, paged by its cursor. Blank threads are never listed."
    },
